+| `chartType` | string | No | — | Resolved registered chart type; omitted on error. |
+| `mode` | `"explicit"` or `"suggest"` | No | — | Whether the chart type was supplied explicitly or chosen by the recommender. |
+| `spec` | object | No | — | Compiled Vega-Lite spec with OODS chrome and series tokens resolved at the requested CSS scope (light/A by default). Scope changes alter chart content and pixel hashes.; additionalProperties: `true` |
